"AND THE VERBS ARE A TOOL SURFACE TOO, READ FROM THE SAME MODEL (Sam, 2026-09-10: the shape of the tools, not only their names). A tool per fact type is the NOUN half of the paper: main:api addresses a resource and a method. The VERB half was reachable only from the CLI, and only for get, because the route passed the wrong operand to the rest (main:verb_pair). Now that the model says what each verb takes, the verbs that say so are a surface: mcp:verbs answers <name, accepts, yields> for every catalogued Operation carrying a `Function accepts Type Expression` row, so a verb becomes callable by declaring its shape in the readings and by nothing else. A verb the model has not described is not listed, which is why this cannot list a verb that would then fail on its operand.",
"SYNTHESIZE: FACT-BASED GENERATION, CHECKED, OR IT FAILS (Sam, 2026-09-10: \"Synthesize should include fact-based generation that is checked by deterministic and semantic rules in a short loop or fail\"). It was catalogued as an Operation, overridable and registrable, and defined NOWHERE -- of the catalogued operations it alone had neither a canon fallback nor a registered row, so the route answered `unknown mode: synthesize`. The generation is the verbalization the paper already carries, solve:report, which is the read inverse: the store's facts spoken as FORML sentences a reader can re-ingest. The check is the store's own deontic verdicts. What is new here is the PARTITION, and it is the difference between a loop that can terminate and one that cannot.",
"AN OBLIGATION NOTHING CAN SATISFY IS UNCHECKED, NOT VIOLATED. support.auto.dev obliges every Message to be natural, truthful and written in masculine Midwest American English; each is a unary with no derivation rule, no marking and no population, so every Message violates all three forever, on a message carrying no text at all (measured 2026-09-10). Counting those as failures makes a repair loop run to its bound and fail whatever the draft says, so registering a judge would be the difference between always-fails and works with no useful state between. An obligation whose fact type has no rule, no derivation marking and no rows can only be settled by a judgement from outside -- llm:validate_judge, the registered class resolution.md declares -- and until one is registered it is reported UNCHECKED. Everything else is deterministic and its verdict is the answer.",
