"WHAT THE EMPTY POPULATION CANNOT TELL YOU, and why this conjunct stays as it is. `It is obligatory that each Source has some Url` with no Source carrying one, and `It is obligatory that each Message is natural` with nothing asserted either way, are the SAME shape to this test: an obliged fact type with an empty population that cmd:deo_viols has named violators of. They mean opposite things -- for the Url the absence IS the non-compliance, for naturalness the absence is nobody having looked -- and no structural test tells them apart, which was measured on 2026-09-10 by making the violations count as a judgement and watching case:synthesize-separates-unchecked-from-violated flip `Message is natural` from unchecked to violated. The model has to say which it is, and it already has the vocabulary: `Constraint is semantic` (core.md:1108, itself derived and currently undelivered on support) and `Constraint is decided by Predicate`, which support populates with three real judges. Wiring those two is the next piece and is not guessed at here.",
