"THE ANSWER CARRIES THE VIOLATIONS THE WRITE INTRODUCED (2026-09-09). A POST answered every deontic violation of the trial store -- on support.auto.dev 666 of them, 35 KB, 620 saying that a function belongs to no domain -- on every write, so the verdict on the response just written was one line in six hundred and sixty, and the outcome word said committed_with_violations for a write that introduced none. The alethic list stays whole, because the gate refuses on the whole of it and a refusal must show its reason; the deontic list is what this write added, the trial's less the prior store's, and the outcome word follows it: committed when the write introduced no warning, committed_with_violations when it did, refused on any alethic. The store's standing warnings are read on the resource they judge, through GET.",
